    { "key": "projectSetup.playXR.foldout", "value": "Play Mode & XR Basics" },
    { "key": "projectSetup.playXR.body", "value": "Entering Play in any scene will load Basis. The boot path is marked with [RuntimeInitializeOnLoadMethod(AfterSceneLoad)] and instantiates the Addressable prefab “BasisFramework”.\n\nXR hotkeys during Play:\n• F10 → OpenVR (SteamVR)\n• F11 → OpenXR" },
    { "key": "projectSetup.playXR.controlFoldout", "value": "Control Boot / XR Startup" },
    { "key": "projectSetup.playXR.controlBody", "value": "Two common flows:\n1) Stop Basis from booting (good for plain-Unity testing).\n2) Desktop-first: let Basis boot, but don’t auto-enter XR; opt in via F10/F11." },
